    31	observed incumbent, candidates/points are double tensors in problem units.
    32	Randomness (candidate scrambling, posterior draws) flows through the global
    33	torch RNG so checkpoint/restore (`backend.checkpoint`) keeps rollouts
    34	reproducible.
