    56	    """Apply `action` on `backend`, return an ActionResult.
    57	
    58	    Raises
    59	    ------
    60	    ValueError
    61	        If action requests more samples than the remaining budget, or if the
    62	        passed `state` is stale (backend has been mutated since extract_state).
    63	    RuntimeError
    64	        If the backend reports an internal error (e.g. BOCoDe evaluation
    65	        failure). The exception propagates without partially mutating history.
    66	    """
